@format 1
@id media-selection.common.files-selection
@title Files selection
@section Media selection
@area Common
@entry row-press, row-release, select-all
@summary Trace shared Files interactions that change or republish the current program media selection without adding or removing media entries.
@related media-preview.in-split, media-preview.in-edit, media-preview.in-convert, media-preview.in-audio, media-preview.in-merge, media-preview.in-funnel
@tag media
@tag selection
@tag common

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[row-press] Files row mouse press <input>
~ This starts with files row mouse press.
[Technical explanation]
- Apply normal, Control, or Shift selection for the pressed row @ list.PListPressHandle(...)
> row-press-publish

[row-release] Files row mouse release <input>
~ This starts with files row mouse release.
[Technical explanation]
- Release a captured row interaction and collapse a retained multi-selection only when a collapse path is pending @ list.PListReleaseHandle(...)
> row-release-result

[select-all] Files Control+A <input>
~ This starts with files Control+A.
[Technical explanation]
- Test Control+A against the current Files selection and docket contents @ list.PListKeyHandle(...)
> select-all-result

[row-press-publish] Publish current path after press <process>
~ The Files list announces the media path selected by the mouse press.
[Technical explanation]
- Publish the selected current path as part of the row-selection operation @ list.PListCurrentApply(...)
> row-press-output

[row-release-result] Release outcome <decision>
~ The program checks whether releasing the mouse changes the selected file.
[Technical explanation]
- Republish the collapsed row only when the earlier press left a collapse path pending @ list.PListReleaseHandle(...)
? "Selection collapsed" > row-release-publish
? "No collapse pending" > row-release-nochange

[select-all-result] Select-all eligibility <decision>
~ The program checks select-all eligibility.
[Technical explanation]
- Apply the full selection only when Control+A, an existing selection, and at least one docket path are present @ list.PListKeyHandle(...)
  @ list.PListSelectionApply(...)
? "Eligible" > select-all-publish
? "Ineligible" > select-all-nochange

[row-press-output] Current path after press <output>
~ This path ends with current path after press.
[Technical explanation]
= PListPathChange subscribers receive the selected program media path.

[row-release-publish] Publish collapsed current path <process>
~ The Files list announces the remaining selected media path.
[Technical explanation]
- Publish the collapsed current path @ list.PListCurrentApply(...)
> row-release-output

[row-release-nochange] Release changes nothing <output>
~ This path ends with release changes nothing.
[Technical explanation]
= No current-path publication occurs.

[select-all-publish] Publish Select All current path <process>
~ The Files list announces the current media path after Select All.
[Technical explanation]
- Preserve the current path when possible, otherwise publish the last selected path @ list.PListCurrentApply(...)
> select-all-output

[select-all-nochange] Select All ignored <output>
~ This path ends with select All ignored.
[Technical explanation]
= No current-path publication occurs.

[row-release-output] Current path after release <output>
~ This path ends with current path after release.
[Technical explanation]
= PListPathChange subscribers receive the republished program media path.

[select-all-output] Current path after Select All <output>
~ This path ends with current path after Select All.
[Technical explanation]
= PListPathChange subscribers receive the published program media path.
